{"speciesId":588,"names":{"fr":"Carabing","es":"Karrablast","en":"Karrablast","ja":"カブルモ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon mystérieux qui évolue quand il reçoit un stimulus électrique en étant proche d’un Escargaume."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"These mysterious Pokémon evolve when they receive electrical stimulation while they are in the same place as Shelmet."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il sent un danger, il se défend en crachant un liquide acide. Il chasse les Escargaume."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When they feel threatened, they spit an acidic liquid to drive attackers away. This Pokémon targets Shelmet."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"For some reason they evolve when they receive electrical energy while they are attacking Shelmet."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"For some reason they evolve when they receive electrical energy while they are attacking Shelmet."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon mystérieux qui évolue quand il reçoit un stimulus électrique en étant proche d’un Escargaume."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si recibe un estímulo eléctrico al estar en contacto con un Shelmet, evoluciona."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"These mysterious Pokémon evolve when they receive electrical stimulation while they are in the same place as Shelmet."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"チョボマキと 一緒に いるときに 電気的な 刺激を 受けると 進化する 不思議な ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pour une raison inconnue, ce Pokémon évolue s’il subit une décharge électrique pendant qu’il attaque un Escargaume."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si recibe una descarga eléctrica durante un combate contra un Shelmet, puede evolucionar. Se desconoce el porqué."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"For some reason they evolve when they receive electrical energy while they are attacking Shelmet."},{"language":"ja","version":"y"